# Server Configuration
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000

# MongoDB Configuration
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/dairy_farm_db

# JWT Configuration
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-in-production
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# Email Configuration (for notifications)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-password
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@dairyfarm.com
EMAIL_FROM_NAME=Dairy Farm Management
NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=your-email@example.com  # Recipient for auto-generated notifications

# How to get Gmail App Password:
# 1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Enable 2-Step Verification if not already enabled
# 3. Search for "App Passwords" or go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Generate a new app password for "Mail"
# 5. Copy the 16-character password (without spaces) and use it as SMTP_PASS above
# 6. Set NOTIFICATION_EMAIL to the email where you want to receive notifications
#
# The system will automatically send pregnancy check reminders 90 days after insemination
# Emails are checked and sent every hour automatically

# ========================================
# Meta Cloud API - WhatsApp Business API
# ========================================
# FREE TIER: 1000 messages/month for production (no sandbox required!)
# 
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Create Meta Developer Account:
#    - Go to https://developers.facebook.com/
#    - Click "Get Started" or "My Apps"
#    - Create a new app (Type: Business)
#
# 2. Add WhatsApp Product:
#    - In your app dashboard, click "Add Product"
#    - Select "WhatsApp" and click "Set up"
#
# 3. Get API Credentials:
#    - Go to WhatsApp > API Setup
#    - Find "Phone Number ID" (NOT your actual phone number)
#    - Copy the Phone Number ID
#    - Click "Generate Token" for temporary token (24 hours)
#    - For permanent token: Create System User > Generate Permanent Token
#
# 4. Add Phone Number:
#    - Follow the steps to register your business phone number
#    - Verify the phone number via SMS/Call
#
# 5. Fill in credentials below:

META_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=your_phone_number_id_here
META_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_permanent_access_token_here

# Important Notes:
# - Phone Number ID is different from your phone number (find in API Setup page)
# - For testing: Use temporary token (valid 24 hours)
# - For production: Use System User permanent token (never expires)
# - Free tier includes 1000 conversation-based pricing messages per month
# - No need to join sandbox - messages work immediately after setup
# - Recipient numbers format: WITHOUT + sign (e.g., 919876543210)
#
# Helpful Links:
# - Get Started: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/whatsapp/cloud-api/get-started
# - API Reference: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/whatsapp/cloud-api/reference/messages
# - Pricing: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/whatsapp/pricing